Package: whisperme
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, pipewire, libxdo3
Description: Speech-to-text daemon using Whisper
 WhisperMe is a Linux speech-to-text daemon that captures audio from
 PipeWire, applies RNNoise noise cancellation, transcribes using
 whisper.cpp, and types the result into the focused window via libxdo.
 .
 Features include real-time streaming transcription, configurable UI
 indicator, and support for multiple Whisper models.
